    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the skies across shifting dimensions!</strong><br><br><strong>MPPP \u2013 Multidimensional Paper Plane Project</strong> is a simple yet challenging game where you try to survive as long as possible in an ever-changing world. Each world in different dimension introduces new mechanics, keeping you on your toes.<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins</strong> and <strong>complete feats</strong> to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through <strong>ever-changing dimensions</strong>, shifting every few seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>7 unique dimensions</strong>, each with its own mechanics inspired by classic and popular mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>secret 8th dimension</strong>\u2014only the luckiest players will find it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the highest score on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the skies across shifting dimensions!</strong><br><br><strong>MPPP \u2013 Multidimensional Paper Plane Project</strong> is a simple yet challenging game where you try to survive as long as possible in an ever-changing world. Each world in different dimension introduces new mechanics, keeping you on your toes.<br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins</strong> and <strong>complete feats</strong> to increase your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through <strong>ever-changing dimensions</strong>, shifting every few seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>7 unique dimensions</strong>, each with its own mechanics inspired by classic and popular mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>secret 8th dimension</strong>\u2014only the luckiest players will find it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the highest score on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fly a paper plane as far as possible in this fast-paced interdimensional arcade challenge. Each dimension changes how the game plays\u2014test your reflexes, adapt on the fly, and see how long you can last.",
